[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/695169104","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335#issuecomment-695169104","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335","id":695169104,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY5NTE2OTEwNA==","user":{"login":"jekbradbury","id":11729078,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzI5MDc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11729078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury","html_url":"https://github.com/jekbradbury","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-09-19T05:46:38Z","updated_at":"2020-09-19T05:46:38Z","body":"On all current XLA platforms, there is only one (default) compute stream per device. That means any asynchronous operation will be enqueued at the _end_ of the current queue for that compute stream, meaning that `jax.device_put(0.).block_until_ready()` will be a valid way to synchronize the whole device. (We could also add a way to do this directly, but that should work for now!)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/695169104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/695188755","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335#issuecomment-695188755","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335","id":695188755,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY5NTE4ODc1NQ==","user":{"login":"dionhaefner","id":11994217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTk0MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11994217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner","html_url":"https://github.com/dionhaefner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-09-19T09:14:21Z","updated_at":"2020-09-19T09:14:21Z","body":"That sounds promising, but unfortunately it doesn't seem to work. I can add the line you proposed to the end of the script and see that it runs *before* my custom XLA call. Is this a CPU vs GPU thing? We're only running on CPU so far.\r\n\r\nIt does seem to work if I JIT it, though:\r\n\r\n```python\r\njax.jit(lambda: jax.device_put)(0.).block_until_ready()\r\n```\r\n\r\nDoes that make sense? It's hard to tell whether this fixes the problem or it just works because it takes longer so execute (so the race condition is less likely to be triggered).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/695188755/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/695337386","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335#issuecomment-695337386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335","id":695337386,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY5NTMzNzM4Ng==","user":{"login":"jekbradbury","id":11729078,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzI5MDc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11729078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury","html_url":"https://github.com/jekbradbury","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jekbradbury/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-09-19T17:48:38Z","updated_at":"2020-09-19T17:48:38Z","body":"You’re right, of course! The snippet I gave doesn’t synchronize the compute stream because it runs on the independent memcpy stream. Jitting it as in your snippet (or running anything that launches an XLA computation) will synchronize the compute stream.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/695337386/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/695784736","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335#issuecomment-695784736","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335","id":695784736,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY5NTc4NDczNg==","user":{"login":"dionhaefner","id":11994217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTk0MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11994217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner","html_url":"https://github.com/dionhaefner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-09-20T13:01:21Z","updated_at":"2020-09-20T13:01:21Z","body":"I use this now:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n(jax.device_put(0.) + 0).block_until_ready()\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhich works OK.\r\n\r\nAn official way to do this would be nice, though, as this workaround seems a bit brittle (relying on JAX implementation details).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/695784736/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/com